# Real Gmail SMTP Credentials
# Instructions:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification (must be ON)
# 2. Search for "App Passwords" or go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an app password for "Academy Platform" (16 lowercase letters, e.g. abcd efgh ijkl mnop)
# 4. Fill in your Gmail address and 16-character App Password below (without spaces):
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
SMTP_FROM_EMAIL=
SMTP_FROM_NAME=Academy Platform
EMAIL_STRICT_MODE=true